# Binance's 00/08/16 -- a genuine 4h offset, 100% consistent over 11,148 stamps since 2016. The
# mechanism is real there and still not clock-worthy: n=1 symbol, the BitMEX leg's round trip is
# UNMEASURED on this desk (breakeven 0.98 bps is printed instead of an invented fee), and a SPOT
# hedge already pays zero funding at every phase without a second venue's round trip.
