# 3-min feed/commit machinery. Known duties from dated observations: runs run_alerts.py
# (journalctl -u quant-refresh.service caught the 07-16 pager bug, docs/GAP_REGISTER.md:247;
# 429s today, 20260729_infrastructure.md:150-151), refreshes the venue-truth feed every 3 min
# (docs/GAP_REGISTER.md:207) and makes the "desk snapshot" commits
# (docs/institutional_knowledge.md:365-367). Its actual ExecStart is NOT in the repo -> exec
# empty; the watchdog cron line covers the same duties as DR backstop.
# EVIDENCE: docs/PROJECT_HANDOFF.md:34 ("quant-refresh.timer (3-min feeds)")
# CONFIDENCE: documented-cadence
SYSTEMD unit="quant-refresh.timer" on="*:0/3" exec=""

# Midnight renewable frontier controller. Its unique unit name deliberately cannot collide with
# deploy/quant-research.service, which remains the autonomous research supervisor.
# EVIDENCE: ops/quant-midnight-frontier.timer, ops/quant-midnight-frontier.service
