# funding plus basis. The desk's own two-sided carry fence already returned BLEED(inverted) on
# those numbers -- and its verdict gated NOTHING, which is the defect this organ exists to end.
# An unattributed WIN is treated as seriously as a loss: the exposure that produced it is still on,
# still unhedged, and will reverse. HOURLY, alongside the other live-state fences.
