# COST HUNT (R0198) -- the one growth lever that needs no proven edge.
# Costs are known BEFORE the trade, they are the whole gap between the 25.0% gross breakeven and
# the 31.1% net one, and near breakeven a third of the cost stack is worth more than a point of
# hit rate. Funding is SIGNED and public: at any moment half the instrument-sides are being PAID
# to hold, and the sleeve was blind to which half. This snapshots the live rate for every
# instrument, ranks paid vs paying sides, and flags the extreme-funding regime the trader's cost
# veto refuses. Selection uses the sign; MARKING stays always-adverse -- different jobs.
