# (was: 7 * * * * cd "$QUANT_ROOT" && flock -n data/.cron_fundxs.lock .venv/bin/python scripts/collect_funding_cross_section.py >> data/cro_ai_logs/funding_cross_section.log 2>&1)

# CROWDING FENCE (R0119 -- §42 capacity parity / L1.19 information decay).
# The desk's capacity assumption is that its carry names are too small for funds to bother with,
# and that assumption had never been instrumented. The incumbent organ run_carry_crowding.py
# measures the top-20 AVERAGE -- our own names are INSIDE it, so a competitor compressing exactly
# our book is diluted ~4:1 and partly subtracted as its own benchmark, making a regime and an
# adversary the same number. This fence takes the RESIDUAL (our rate minus the cross-section at
# the same instant) plus the unit-free rank, and alarms only when BOTH tells agree.
# CADENCE CEILING: DATA-ARRIVAL, keyed to its producer -- it can say nothing the tape has not
# already recorded, so hourly-after-the-collector is its maximum useful rate.
# PHASE :46 -- inside the fence cluster (:40 clock provenance, :43 funding capture, :45), and 39
# minutes after the collector so a snapshot is always on tape before it is read.
# EVIDENCE: scripts/check_crowding.py -> data/crowding_status.json; CONSTITUTION L1.19 / §42
# RETIRED 2026-09-05 under the MT5 universe mandate (2026-08-18): scripts/check_crowding.py was
