# CIRCULATING-SUPPLY HISTORY -- the half of the unlock screen that can ONLY be built forward.
# screen_unlock_supply_series is blocked on two inputs and they are NOT symmetric: the unlock
# CALENDAR is a published schedule that can be obtained later with its history intact, while the
# circulating-supply SERIES is a point-in-time observation nobody sells a trustworthy history of.
# Every day this does not run is a day that can never be recovered, so it starts first even though
# it does not on its own unblock the screen. Starting the recoverable half first is the order a
# desk drifts into precisely because that half shows progress sooner.
