# THE LAW POLICE -- who watches the watchmen. Every other check on this desk answers "are the laws
# being broken today?"; this answers the question that decides whether their answers mean anything:
# IS THE AUDIT STILL LOOKING? Three ways a law silently stops being enforced, none of which raises
# a defect today -- a check deleted from CHECKS (its defects stop appearing and the report gets
# BETTER), a check passing VACUOUSLY (it returns early because its artifact is gone, which is
# indistinguishable from a clean pass), and a defect that disappears because the detector went
# blind rather than because anything was fixed.
# FOUND ON ITS FIRST TWO PASSES: `bnb-funded` and `fee-carry-ratio` both swallowed their own
# failure (`except Exception: pass` / `return`) and reported all-clear having measured NOTHING --
# so the §40 fee ratchet and the BNB rack-rate detector were unenforced for exactly as long as the
# venue was unreachable, silently. Both now report UNKNOWN. It also cried wolf on four checks in
# its first version (they consult the network, git and module globals rather than files); the
# metric now counts any external consultation, because an alarm that is mostly false is an alarm
# nobody hears, and this desk has already lost eleven and a half days to that.
# CEILING TYPE (L1.28c) is INFORMATION-ARRIVAL: it grades the audit, so it runs once per audit
# cycle and no more. 55 past the hour puts it AFTER max_audit's own daily pass, since grading a
# sweep before it has run would measure yesterday's roster against yesterday's evidence.
# AUTHORITY: repairs ONLY by re-running idempotent measurement organs from an explicit per-defect
# allowlist, each additionally screened against a never-touch token list (deadman switch,
# thresholds, gates, sizing, promotion, deletion). Everything else is reported for a person -- a
# police force that can rewrite the law is not enforcing it.
# EVIDENCE: scripts/run_law_police.py -> data/LAW_POLICE.json + reports/law_police.json. First
# clean run 2026-08-05: WATCHING, 95 checks, 95 evaluating, 0 blind spots, 44 distinct defects.
# CONFIDENCE: measured (counts read from the artifact). rc 1 on an unexplained fall pages.
55 9 * * * cd "$QUANT_ROOT" && flock -n data/.cron_law_police.lock .venv/bin/python scripts/run_law_police.py >> data/cro_ai_logs/law_police.log 2>&1

