# NATURAL EXPERIMENT -- the desk's first CAUSAL study (R0207, 2026-08-05). Every hypothesis this
# desk had ever tested was OBSERVATIONAL: an IC or a Sharpe on a correlational panel, defended by
# de-contamination and multiplicity control. Both defences establish that a relationship is not an
# ARTIFACT; neither establishes that it is CAUSAL. This is difference-in-differences over dated
# token unlocks against a matched control cohort, with the identification rails (parallel trends,
# placebo, SUTVA) that separate identification from a correlation with better vocabulary.
