# present, denominator/attrition ask whether I scanned anything. An organ can pass all five while
# asserting the opposite of the organ beside it, because CONTRADICTION IS NOT A PROPERTY OF ANY
# SINGLE ARTIFACT -- it exists only in the relation between two, and nothing held two at once.
# STATUS: OK / PARTIAL (exit 0, gap is a work queue) / CONTRADICTED (exit 2) / UNMEASURED (exit 2
