# --- ORGANS BORN UNWIRED, 2026-08-27..09-04 (birth-property fence, 2026-09-05) ----------------
# Eight scripts were committed by seat builds with no cadence, no caller and no runbook -- each
# one's own docstring names the clock it expected. Wired here at the cadence the docstring asks
# for; each writes its artifact under data/ and exits non-zero only on a finding it names.
# CONFIDENCE: committed-script (slots chosen here, clear of every existing exact minute).

# scripts/run_desk_integrity.py -- reads the PAIRS that a rollback breaks (canon vs report,
# registry vs state, manifest vs installed timer). --report is the audit half only: the three
# repairers it can run (universe floor, artifact rollback, schedule parity --fix-schedules)
# change tracked files and stay a principal decision, not a cadence chosen in a CI repair.
# EVIDENCE: scripts/run_desk_integrity.py -> data/desk_integrity.json
26 * * * * cd "$QUANT_ROOT" && flock -n data/.cron_desk_integrity.lock .venv/bin/python scripts/run_desk_integrity.py --report >> data/cro_ai_logs/desk_integrity.log 2>&1

# scripts/check_promotion_readiness.py -- what each certificate would be worth and be sized at,
# BEFORE anything is armed (LAWS III.16). Daily, after shadow_forward's 07:58 pass has written
# the forward evidence it ranks. It arms nothing.
# EVIDENCE: scripts/check_promotion_readiness.py -> data/promotion_readiness.json
12 8 * * * cd "$QUANT_ROOT" && .venv/bin/python scripts/check_promotion_readiness.py >> data/cro_ai_logs/promotion_readiness.log 2>&1

# scripts/check_capability_registry.py -- ORPHANED / TEST_ONLY / WIRED / ACTIVE for every
# capability the repo defines ("answers it on a clock"). Daily.
# EVIDENCE: scripts/check_capability_registry.py -> data/capability_registry.json
20 8 * * * cd "$QUANT_ROOT" && .venv/bin/python scripts/check_capability_registry.py >> data/cro_ai_logs/capability_registry.log 2>&1

# scripts/check_dual_context_imports.py -- a module importable two ways must import two ways;
# the box-only ImportError class measured three times on 2026-08-29. Daily (~60s over 898
# modules).
# EVIDENCE: scripts/check_dual_context_imports.py -> data/dual_context_imports.json
50 8 * * * cd "$QUANT_ROOT" && .venv/bin/python scripts/check_dual_context_imports.py >> data/cro_ai_logs/dual_context_imports.log 2>&1

# scripts/check_backtest_realism.py -- a published framework's bug list run as a standing audit
# of OUR engine ("WHY IT RUNS ON A CLOCK: a cost model is edited more often than it is audited,
# and the failure is silent by construction"). Daily.
# EVIDENCE: scripts/check_backtest_realism.py -> data/backtest_realism.json
55 8 * * * cd "$QUANT_ROOT" && .venv/bin/python scripts/check_backtest_realism.py >> data/cro_ai_logs/backtest_realism.log 2>&1

# scripts/act_on_findings.py -- deep-audit findings and data blocks become routed work daily
# (principal 2026-08-30); exits non-zero on an UNROUTED block by design. Reads data/deep_audit.json
# whenever the audit has written one.
# EVIDENCE: scripts/act_on_findings.py -> data/act_on_findings.json
20 10 * * * cd "$QUANT_ROOT" && .venv/bin/python scripts/act_on_findings.py >> data/cro_ai_logs/act_on_findings.log 2>&1

# scripts/run_research_intake.py -- THE caller for the semantic space, novelty engine,
# tri-alignment gate and halving ladder (LAWS III.16); reports the toll, kills nothing yet.
# Daily under a lock: the docket is >20k candidates.
# EVIDENCE: scripts/run_research_intake.py -> data/research_intake.json
45 10 * * * cd "$QUANT_ROOT" && flock -n data/.cron_research_intake.lock .venv/bin/python scripts/run_research_intake.py >> data/cro_ai_logs/research_intake.log 2>&1

# scripts/purge_untradeable_certs.py -- archives certificates on symbols the broker does not
# list ("IDEMPOTENT ... safe on a timer"); refuses on a truncated universe. Daily, after the
# hourly gauntlet has minted.
# EVIDENCE: scripts/purge_untradeable_certs.py -> desks/mt5/data/UNTRADEABLE_CERTS.json
30 11 * * * cd "$QUANT_ROOT" && .venv/bin/python scripts/purge_untradeable_certs.py >> data/cro_ai_logs/purge_untradeable_certs.log 2>&1

# HOURLY DISCOVERY (principal 2026-09-05: every miner, proposer and data organ hourly at
# minimum). One pass an hour, each organ in its own subprocess on a bandit-weighted budget behind
# the memory guard; the :05 pipeline compiles what the pass donated. The daily cycle keeps its
# full-budget runs. EVIDENCE: desks/mt5/reports/HOURLY_DISCOVERY.json (per-organ status),
# desks/mt5/data/hourly_discovery_state.json (ordering by staleness).
SYSTEMD unit="quant-hourly-discovery.timer" on="*:35" exec="ops/run_hourly_discovery.sh"
